            "notes": "[Iaido Strike](item_0b4def91-53c9-4bb7-b706-05aff6e4b168) adds a huge burst damage tool to Genji's kit that starts strong and scales very easily. Taking advantage of the fact that Blade scales off both WP and AP, [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) bumps its damage by 10% and getting both lifesteal items nets you a whopping 20% lifesteal on blade swings, healing up to 24hp per hit.\n\n---\n\nAs with most other heroes, Genji largely plays the same as normal Overwatch in the first round, but the massively boosted offensive potential of deflect now makes securing kills far easier. I use the Iaido swing as a good closer to clean up consistent backline picks on supports.",
