            "created_at": "2025-07-18T18:05:46.081034+00:00",
            "notes": "[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is just too good of an item for hybrid AP/WP builds. This is the biggest single item power spike for Iaido strike, offering a monstrous 20% buff to blade along with 30% lifesteal to make duels just that much easier to survive. $11000 should be obtainable even with the worst of round 1 performances, and depending on how much cash is available try to keep [Shady Spectacles](item_ef9bb72f-a56c-4fb6-a552-5abce0b943d7) and [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318).\n\n---\n\nI like to start engagements by just farming overheal with primary fire, and combined with the solid self heals, 1v1 or even 1v2 duels are even easier than before. Just be careful about throwing out Iaido too eagerly, deflect is still your primary defensive tool and the enemy should be getting settled into their own burst builds by now.",
