            "created_at": "2025-07-18T18:05:46.081034+00:00",
            "notes": "Since we'll be building AP anyway, [Laceration](item_ee831ad3-3921-4aca-a761-c6b93cc7e7fe) is just free damage waiting to be picked up. [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b) is the next key item to add, at max stacks the 10% WP and 25% AP get you the largest straight damage boost on Iaido, essentially just Champion's Kit for 4k less. Try to add [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) if econ permits.\n\n---\n\nSuperflexor will get you a massive damage spike, now making your Iaido swings hit for 170 each as long as you land 5 shurikens (on any enemy, doesn't have to be the same one) beforehand. Fan, swift strike, fan, Iaido should result in a kill confirm on most squishies.",
