            "created_at": "2025-07-18T18:05:46.081034+00:00",
            "notes": "[Wyrm\u2019s Maw](item_5d8c3488-13a9-432a-987e-275522f68cc4) is essentially just an extension of [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b), further buffing swift strike and making assassinations that much easier. [Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) adds 25 damage to Iaido which is an effective 22% damage boost, and also gives you some more burst damage on shurikens after a dash. This is a very flexible item, since it applies as ability damage you can combine it with [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) later for a healing reduction build or maximize your dash-fan combos with [Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) in round 7. Try to have [Nano Cola](item_79b22609-8046-4a8a-a5a2-bb49cd7e11c6) and [Energized Bracers](item_f83a1d9e-91f8-4d2c-bd62-c673b8d9fd2e) if econ permits.\n\n---\n\nYour build should be pretty much complete by round 5, with only the finishing touches coming in 6 and 7. At this point we've more or less completed the AP side of the build, so your dash/Iaido setup should be incredibly lethal.",
