            "created_at": "2025-07-18T18:05:46.081034+00:00",
            "notes": "There's a lot of flexibility with how you approach the final round. [Eye of the Spider](item_bbaf01d7-340d-4199-b738-86a98d68fe9b) will bring up your shurikens to a more respectable number for the endgame, but as for the rest of your selections it's largely played by ear. I usually replace [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) with [Hidden Blade](item_a820416d-85e5-4018-b20a-dc1cbf744900) to maintain survivability and reclaiming some currency before picking up  [Cybervenom](item_210a8582-91ec-4cf3-968a-a443f3a0c505) and [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) to combat some of the insane healing output available in late game. If you have the currency, stretch for [Hardlight Accelerator](item_0390c8af-2a68-4da2-b876-93da32c3f448) or [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) to squeeze out a bit more damage.\n\n---\n\nBy this point the enemy is sure to expect your massive Iaido slugs so the more flighty characters like juno and mercy are quite challenging to lock down. Having heal reduction helps a ton here with securing kills, but if you're relying less on Iaido in general you could pivot to [Hashimoto\u2019s Bane](item_03650ff3-917e-45fe-aeed-11c0f24c0eba) and [The Closer](item_173c6d0f-dbe6-440e-924f-0ce08189ddce) for upped shuriken damage.",
